  "body_html": "<p>Bring a touch of magical wonder into your bedroom with this custom dragon bedding set by Jeminise. Perfect for kids, teens, and fantasy animal lovers, this soft and breathable bedding features a stunning purple winged dragon galaxy design that turns any sleep space into an enchanting retreat. Whether used for deep night sleeping or cozy afternoon napping, this customizable set adds unique style and comfort to any bedroom setting.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable options with one custom text input line to add your name or unique request.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from a premium microfiber and cotton-polyester blend fabric for ultimate softness and breathability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Enchanting Visuals:</strong> Showcases a purple fantasy galaxy design featuring a winged dragon, starry nebula patterns, and a dragon tail.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flexible Bedding Options:</strong> Available as a quilt set or comforter set, with options to choose your ideal size and select matching pillow shams.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Completely machine washable for quick, hassle-free maintenance and long-lasting freshness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set or Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragon Quilt D8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Queen, Twin, Full, King, Throw</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses</th>\n<td>Napping</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
